# Commit settings and SQLite

When committing or pushing, **always stage and include**:

- `config/adlexone_settings.json` (and other live `config/*.json` that are tracked)
- `storage/database/adlexone.sqlite`

Do not leave these unstaged as “local only.” Adam wants the live settings and database in git so environments stay in sync.
